  <section class="section narrow prose">
    <h2>Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      The contemporary workplace combines knowledge work with a host of new health challenges: long
      hours on the screen, static posture and constant stress from digital environments. Studies
      consistently show that if left unchecked, these variables can lead to deteriorating quality of
      vision, musculoskeletal stress and increased stress — which are detrimentally counterproductive
      on a personal as well as organizational level.
    </p>

    <h2>Vision Care</h2>
    <p>
      Occupational health studies confirm that prolonged exposure to digital screens causes computer
      vision syndrome (CVS), a range of eye-related symptoms taking in everything from eye strain and
      tired, crumpled eyes right through to headaches. There is evidence to support the efficacy of
      brief structured eye exercises and guided visual breaks for the relief of such symptoms.
      Meditize blends these interventions into the work day and promotes micro-practices that shield
      and restore visual performance.
    </p>

    <h2>Posture and Musculoskeletal Health</h2>
    <p>
      Inactive lifestyle and bad posture are directly linked to musculoskeletal pains and long time
      spinal problems. Principles of ergonomics for regular movement, posture change and based
      information on micro break are useful risk reduction approaches. Meditize uses behavioral cues
      and AI driven nudges to enhance body posture awareness at the most relevant time itself by
      inducing corrective actions.
    </p>

    <h2>Stress and Cognitive Load</h2>
    <p>
      Work stress is aggravated by always being on and mental overload. Studies in behavioral science
      show that practices of focused mindfulness and measured breathing induce stress reducing
      markers and enhance focus. Meditize includes research-based guided meditations and AI based
      interventions that can be used in the short periods of time to improve productivity without
      breaking their workflow.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Scientific Approach</h2>
    <p>
      What sets Meditize apart is how it takes peer-reviewed results and translates them into
      actionable, practical habits. Behavioural science meets AI personalisation:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Behavioural science makes sure the interventions are evidence based.</li>
      <li>
        AI adjusts the timing, frequency and kind of exercise to the user’s working rhythm for better
        adherence and efficacy.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Conclusion</h2>
    <p>
      Workplace wellness is now not secondary but a core driver of sustained performance. By
      grounding its method in the fields of vision care, posture science and stress management
      studies, Meditize delivers an evidence-based toolkit for companies and individuals to have a
      healthier, more productive workday.
    </p>

